/.claude/rules/CLAUDE.md
# Test-pattern inputs are TRACKED until development is complete (user decision).
# The directory is listed as `/input/*` rather than `/input` on purpose: git does
# not descend into an ignored *directory*, so the negations below would never be
# considered. Scratch files of other types stay ignored.
/input/*
!/input/*.svg
!/input/*.sm2d
/logs
/output
/target
